          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Read <a href="{{ site.handbookUrl }}">the handbook</a> before your first
            task.</strong> It covers what each job actually asks of you, and where the judgement
            calls are.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Read the house style before you write.</strong> British English, and short beats
            elaborate.
          </li>
        </ol>
